  "id": "f_ml_ai",
  "category": "ml_ai",
  "statement": "Acme Observability Inc. ml_ai is 6.7% of headcount vs competitor median 0.0%–1.0% (5 companies); violates policy 'ML/AI share of headcount within 20% of competitor median'. Matching the competitor median would take 22 fewer to 19 fewer people (≈ $5,280,000 less to $4,466,786 less a year at Acme Observability Inc.'s loaded cost; estimate).",
