   "agreement": 0.0,
   "signals_score": 0.0,
   "oldest_input_days": 1,
   "freshness_score": 1.0
  },
  "status": "overturned",
  "audit_notes": [
   "gpt-5-nano: overturn — Contradictory ml_ai signals: Honeycomb shows ml_share_job_search=0 and ml_share_engineering_2y=9; Sentry shows ml_share_recent_titles=0 and ml_share_job_search=5 (as of 2026-10-11/2026-10-10). These data points imply ml_ai headcount shares near 0–9%, not 6.7%, and do not support the claim that Acme Observability Inc.'s ml_ai share is within 20% of the competitor median. The evidence data and timestamps differ from the original dataset and undermine the robustness of the finding.",
   "second opinion gemini-3.5-flash-lite: downgrade — The contradicting evidence regarding competitor ml_ai signals shows mixed data points up to 9 percent, weakening the confidence of the violation relative to the 0.0 percent to 1.0 percent median benchmark."
  ]
